{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y削弱了X中随音乐进程逐步出现的细微情绪变化和音乐细节，部分感受被压缩成概括性词语，细腻度有所下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物的行为、顾虑和心理因果组织成连续的话，普通观众即使没读过前文，也比较容易理解每段发生了什么、他为什么这样想，以及情绪为什么发生变化。X的重点加亮确实更容易瞬间抓住关键词，随音乐出现的感受也更细腻具体，但大量感受碎片交替出现，容易让注意力在人物故事和音乐意象之间来回跳转；Y整体更容易读懂并形成连贯的情感体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ce2c8cc-8304-417a-92e9-01fe2967b622", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164011613953Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:41:10.050410+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8889114d16bc59b3c229b18968b0b8be7d8e0fe310b4bc7d94570eb18464273c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "